  "interpretation": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Clinical Use</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"864\">\n<p data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"748\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Useful for diagnosing tumors with <strong data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"736\">SMARCB1/INI-1 gene alterations</strong>, such as:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"864\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"799\">\n<p data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"799\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"797\">Atypical Teratoid/Rhabdoid Tumor (AT/RT)</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"834\">\n<p data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"834\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"832\">Malignant Rhabdoid Tumor</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"864\">\n<p data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"864\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"862\">Epithelioid Sarcoma</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"941\">\n<p data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"941\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"895\">Loss of INI-1 expression</strong> supports the diagnosis of these malignancies.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
